**Evaluating output requirements**

I noticed a potential mistake regarding the baseline outputs, which should be self-contained and no claims are needed. The normalized error goal for tolerance is set quite strictly at 3e-7 when the actual is 1e-10, which is good. I want to ensure we can finish after polling without repeat. Running the tools sessions may take about 5 seconds, and user latency could be around 60 seconds. I have to be efficient with waits in the tool commands.
